            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MRSKNIGHT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added a prepared box of vanilla pudding to help make it more \"light and fluffy\" per another review warning of it sticking to the roof of one's mouth. I also put it into an oreo crust, instead of graham cracker and that was a fun change. I mixed it longer than normal to whip air into it. It's good chilled or frozen. I do think PB pies are better with whipped topping mixed in, but I had none and was craving this cold, creamy PB flavor."
          },
