              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gina w"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My \"batter\" was the consistency of cookie dough. I wondered if I had omitted something, but after reading the recipe again, I realized I'd done everything exactly as instructed. I think I will take the advice of a previous post and add Cool Whip.",
