            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this and it did not turn out light and fluffy. So to make it light and fluffy I added a 8 ounce tub of cool whip whipped topping and whipped it with my mixer until it was light and fluffy. It was sinful!!!!!If you make it do add the cool whip with the other ingredients. -Gina",
